    {"nameRaw": "芭万·希 / 崔斯坦(妖精骑士崔斯坦)", "roleStatusRaw": "摩根王庭（妖精圆桌）；自毁右手断后；杀死伍德沃斯取其核心；舞会上被击败并曝光真名芭万·希；盗取秘术『庭』", "sourceRefs": ["sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-100-lb6-1-avalon-pre.txt:24", "sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-100-lb6-1-avalon-pre.txt:79", "sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-100-lb6-1-avalon-pre.txt:113", "sources/worldbook-script/lostbelt/ch-100-lb6-1-avalon-pre.txt:116-117"], "sourceType": "user-file-worldbook-script", "credibility": "B", "canonStatus": "canon-like"},
